              "body": {
                "oneOfData": {
                  "oneOfCase": "RRT_V2_BLOCK_ELEMENTS_JSON",
                  "rrtV2BlockElementsJson": "{\"children\":[[\"paragraph\",{\"numbering\":\"#none\",\"indent-level\":0,\"children\":[[\"text\",{\"value\":\"A: How did you enjoy Dr. Harrison’s speech?\\nB: It was good, but it wasn’t his best speech. I’ve seen him at other seminars, and he spoke much better.\\nA: Well, this was the first time I’ve seen him, and he impressed me. Anyway, what shall we do next?\\nB: I’m thinking of listening to Tina Campbell’s talk. She’s going to discuss an interesting subject.\\nA: Oh, yeah? I was going to sit in at Josh Martin’s presentation, but if you think Ms. Campbell’s talk will be good, we can go there together.\\nB: It will definitely be worth your time.\\nA: Okay. Then let’s find out which room she is speaking in.\"}]]}]]}"
                }
              }
